# ArduPlane Parameters - Mini Talon Airspeed Overlay (envelope cell: max28)
# Apply on top of plane_base.parm for Gazebo wind / pitot worlds.
#
# Envelope Sensitivity Matrix cell (ADR-0012, ADR-0013): MAX-ONLY (high ceiling).
# Identical to config/overlays/plane_airspeed.parm EXCEPT AIRSPEED_MAX, so the
# ceiling is the only changed variable. This is a headline cell: it tests
# whether the ramp plateau-onset moves with AIRSPEED_MAX. Run at n=3.
#
# OPEN VALIDATION (ADR-0012 Consequences): MAX=28 with cruise=14 is an untested
# regime for this airframe. One flyability smoke flight MUST pass before the n=3
# reps are spent; if it is not flyable in a tuned envelope, substitute a lower
# high-max value and record the substitution in ADR-0012.
#
# One-source rule:
# - Gazebo provides wind
# - SITL wind remains disabled

ARSPD_TYPE       100       # JSON airspeed sensor from Gazebo / ArduPilotPlugin
ARSPD_USE        1
ARSPD_AUTOCAL    0         # Do not learn offset from live wind on startup
ARSPD_SKIP_CAL   1         # Keep startup from zeroing in active wind
ARSPD_OFFSET     0

# Max-only envelope cell: ceiling raised to 28, cruise held at baseline 14.
AIRSPEED_CRUISE  14
AIRSPEED_MIN     10
AIRSPEED_MAX     28
STALL_PREVENTION 1

SIM_WIND_SPD     0
SIM_WIND_DIR     180
SIM_WIND_TURB    0
AHRS_WIND_MAX    15
